# Qu1cksc0pe runtime artifacts written to the repo root by direct CLI use
# (Web UI / MCP server archive their copies into sc0pe_reports/ instead,
# already covered above; these are the loose files a plain
# `python qu1cksc0pe.py --file ... --report` run leaves behind)
